-2\"><strong>「山形県の旅で後悔しない確かな満足感と贅沢な癒しを得るなら迷わずここ！」</strong></p>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F27923%2F27923.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】かみのやま温泉　日本の宿　古窯 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">💡 山形・銀山・蔵王旅行に関するよくある質問（FAQ）</h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            蔵王温泉の強酸性泉の特徴と入浴時の注意点は？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> pH1.5前後の強酸性硫黄泉で、殺菌力と美肌効果が極めて高い名湯です。貴金属（指輪・ネックレス等）は変色するため必ず外し、目に入らないよう注意して入浴しましょう。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            山寺（宝珠山立石寺）の石段登山と所要時間は？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 山頂の奥の院まで1,015段の石段があり、往復で約1時間半かかります。滑りにくいスニーカーでの参拝が必須です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            山形市街地の名物グルメは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 『冷やしラーメン（栄屋本店発祥）』『山形芋煮』『鳥中華』『山形牛ステーキ』が名物です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！山形県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 山形県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-tohoku-maitake-beef-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】東北 天然舞茸・山形牛・米沢牛と強酸性硫黄泉の名湯旅館特集！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">蔵王・山形</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-tohoku-yonezawagyu-sukiyaki-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n      